{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mfJeF9gvxkRuKhi7_eZX_g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:27.715589+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mfJeF9gvxkRuKhi7_eZX_g","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadGcHegc7t1oCcnW18WtpxpWlM6KT50hOfzemwRf3EW1GGcsYibLjibaUbmzCjv959CZ0k99Q966jnFKnHerS4J9GErTQic7dXj3mKyPicslVbw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3DRUbqWXWrVMicXicvlNicCJD7e4dKlndQnEuJg4RLwrAwjZt9IMQr1zTZ0bA7Jj1xqqXLTk3eGL2moaiaDAc3R3mz0nicL53RXBKI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3zqCFFHiaWBoEtwX62G3c3IZxYXxbXIeLEZ391nibcZQUQo33NAz3ECws1DJKsGKzYwnMhHyJLEWmsyBacKxkP0xF4H63TluqBM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>南京理工大学材料科学与工程学院起源于新中国最高军事学府“哈军工”金工金相教研室，1981年获博士学位授予权，2001年材料学入选国家重点学科，先后获批工信部两化融合重点学科、国防特色学科和江苏省优势学科，拥有一级博士点两个，包括材料科学与工程和材料与化工，其中材料科学与工程一级博士点建设有博士后流动站。学院学科方向具有“军民融合、前沿交叉”鲜明特色，ESI学科前</span><span><em><strong><span>0.46‰</span></strong></em></span><span>。现建有包括全国重点实验室、国际联合中心在内的省部级以上科研平台。近年来承担国家自然科学基金重大集成项目、两机专项等系列重大项目，获国家技术发明二等奖、中国专利金奖等国家级科技奖励4项。科教融合，重大项目育能育魂特色鲜明，获全国“挑战杯”、“国创赛”特等奖、金奖</span><strong><em><span><span>10</span></span></em></strong><span>余项，获国家级教学成果奖</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>项。40多年来，为社会输送了大批优秀人才。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3hAkfibnf8fKfobgurnic9p2leRQA5YhAGts6sZBImR5l2ibpX6PqhKe2F5Q5JLg5Ozrkfj9HiauIhR8J8iarz72lC27jpmVHf90TA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>材料科学与工程学院</span></strong></span><span>现有教职工</span><strong><em><span><span>180</span></span></em></strong><span>人（专任教师</span><strong><em><span><span>135</span></span></em></strong><span>人，博士后</span><strong><em><span><span>27</span></span></em></strong><span>人），其中教授/研究员</span><strong><em><span><span>69</span></span></em></strong><span>人，副教授/副研究员</span><strong><em><span><span>68</span></span></em></strong><span>人，博士生导师</span><strong><em><span><span>60</span></span></em></strong><span>人，硕士生导师</span><strong><em><span><span>56</span></span></em></strong><span>人。拥有中国科学院院士</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人、国家级领军人才</span><strong><em><span><span>9</span></span></em></strong><span>人、国家级青年人才</span><strong><em><span><span>28</span></span></em></strong><span>人、“万人计划”教学名师</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、全国创新争先奖得主</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人、国务院特殊津贴专家</span><strong><em><span><span>3</span></span></em></strong><span>人。形成“院士领航、领军人才掌舵、中青年骨干攻坚”的一流师资梯队，为国家国防装备与关键材料领域的突破提供了最硬核的人才支撑。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0iay7xOg2y5Ngks4icry3m0AGyKkwllGETlSESdsB4vLq5giaEP2E4OP88OjJia1Emht0OvHpF0nFaK2wPPA1jhgZCicg04x7ID99U/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>材料科学与工程学院民口科研强势跃升，国防科研实力雄厚，承担了国家自然科学基金重大集成项目、国家科技重大专项、国家重点研发计划、国防重大重点等在内的一大批国家级重大重点项目，近五年累计到校经费</span><strong><em><span><span>7</span></span></em></strong><span>亿元。建有“特种车辆设计制造集成技术全国重点实验室”、“高端装备铸造技术全国重点实验室”、微纳米材料与技术国际联合研究中心等在内的国家级及省部级平台</span><strong><em><span><span>11</span></span></em></strong><span>个。获国家技术发明二等奖、国家科学技术进步二等奖、国际科学技术合作奖、中国专利金奖、陈嘉庚科学奖等国家级和省部级一等奖励</span><strong><em><span><span>17</span></span></em></strong><span>项。累计发表高水平学术论文</span><strong><em><span><span>1000</span></span></em></strong><span>余篇，在《Nature》《Science》正刊及《Nature Materials》等子刊发表论文</span><strong><em><span><span>50</span></span></em></strong><span>余篇，多项原创性基础研究成果领跑国际材料学科前沿。学院科研平台完善、项目资源充沛、名师团队云集，兼具国防硬核实力与民口创新活力，为学子深造研学、科创实践、就业发展搭建高层次优质平台。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0NvD8ZLwnyic2icYERzg0dUVPQLBfVJGVMoCVR7G2joR4CCkrruXDZ7Vvicjt5ic3Dj0yHEYv9MY9Bh0VOEUEC3YtYAIbASe1CvXk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t03SibYhD1sYtEicQvDSmoQarpiaXZp2xGNbgsXsIzscLyzsqf3Tz9AS7mPxSMQbpOa6EDtZDoOe6ZjD3qazG3vTxeiaGBic2Vh0pKY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t37ccm6SSMvWyPGgAZkbAjib0PydickvukZ24Kylw1icQSKZPAOhtwKa1LIUU0MnJMGOk5kK8icBiblQ5Z6eCGf2nHeRiaVwWzIeS0m8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1OynDgm5MqotiaDNBsOs6Qty3KB7BuRQmv4ubo3E5iclaicHrLTAKpazx0tJuvWadMj0Q598W5c4iadUDb053HB4PKPJbGXkoiaBWo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>150人</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月1日-7月8日（不在时间范围内的申请无效）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>该部分内容应包括对报名人员的专业、成绩、品德、心理等方面的要求，可参考如下内容：</span></p><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2027年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业为</span><strong><span><span>材料科学与工程</span></span></strong><span>及相近专业，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>5</span></strong></span><strong><span>.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过</span><span><strong><span>邮件</span></strong></span><span>方式进行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请表</span></p><p><span>（2）个人陈述</span></p><p><span>（3）本人居民身份证和学生证复印件。</span></p><p><span>（4）由教务处或所在院系开具的现有本科阶段成绩单与专业总评成绩排名证明（须学校教务部门或学院盖章）。</span></p><p><span>（5）外语水平证明（如CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等的证书或成绩单）。</span></p><p><span>（6）其它能证明本人成绩及潜力的材料，如校级及以上获奖证书、公开发表的学术论文、资格证书等复印件。</span></p><p><span>请申请人将以上材料</span><span><strong><span>按序号整理排序</span></strong></span><span>，合并成一个PDF，要求</span><strong><span><span>有目录和页码</span></span></strong><span>等，方便专家审阅。</span></p><p><span>PDF命名方式：</span><strong><span><span>校园开放日2026申请资料-本科院校名称-姓名。</span></span></strong></p><p><span>PDF文件需压缩后，在</span><strong><span><span>7月9日上午8:00前</span></span></strong><span>（不在时间范围内的发送无效）发送至邮箱</span><span><strong><span>yz116@njust.edu.cn</span></strong></span><span>，请勿重复发送。</span></p><p><span>所提交的材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，将取消申请资格。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院通过利用线上资源开展政策宣讲、专家报告、师生研讨、师生互动沙龙及研究生座谈等多形式的活动。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t16b6NAaXsTAkxciayV6WWTNicKtccKZQQnufpT8hgFwFe1Pxmoz6m8TibDO3qibrPav4N0DSuaNQj2FthUpn5ygicDoicY5TWe9XuHA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系人：蒋老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span><span>025-84314985</span></span></p><p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span><span><span>yz116@njust.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>QQ群:653564141</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>南理工研招公众号</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t20m5iaNUatQ5zOxom65P7GBxAJJ4icsBbzLAhU5IeQ2zAPeyYDG3mDjJibQdtoxmkG0GZxVxrRuUKmTaMrOWhJibFqmSibVXM4ZfIg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2EWRFkvyYyicZiaecTFaIbDNaS4O6Xf589fJsAbBJcefE3fBHkLmoIuTusxaHnk47bBj3s6mkciasYf61wpTCxJRLw40gbibtMDU4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>南理工材料院公众号</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院导师公众号</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0LkX6pwo9wC5hRU87baPhqYd9DM8PvMAia7CStLZibSra8yM4e1eg5SFrNPR9l1ncxDATtlVdicO5UalYiabnfejAeTia0INV4OYOM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3I0VR0LhvNZSATvHmWHwutREibIibXk0B8SssJvfgiahyFjcej4vGHKhnKIBOyQjMgxCN8mzIxCnGicdcvU2pqYgHWeicNR6pOr1Qc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t07JMtmeSBBIYG1jqpHNmyj3HEBpGXStOiasOB2E86tTmAIZucib9lG3Rb6Al3RMiaTRRMhiaSABmDYaxL1QE0kEy6RPrgAnI5YqpU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 材料科学与工程学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 吴雅琪</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华 材料科学与工程学院</span></p><p><span>审核 | 于雷</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1xeZo5f4VUMUqttvzsgAibCrc7ElzuTktaVjnkuj5Ouia77KUuxy2UBlbwQCwSiavsNicduOSyUzJ4vtLGp6h5rSt1ictoVrfaK8Tk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"4d1ccb2b8cd89dedce7cdb9c2c3c7f442141f55a871e10be5ce1f978a4752081","textLength":1891,"sourceSha256":"1badbf1371828af3727a351fa976d71b091ce9507b8369d5a39e29292c8d645e","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8ab5fa70957630b26bf9","title":"2026年南京理工大学材料科学与工程学院2026年全国“优秀大学生”校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:27.715589+00:00"}
